        "zh-CN": "使用这个插件完成以下任务：A mobile-app screen rendered inside a pixel-accurate iPhone 15 Pro frame on the page. Built by copying the seed `assets/template.html` and pasting one screen archetype from `references/layouts.md`. Use when the brief asks for \"mobile app\", \"iOS app\", \"Android app\", \"phone screen\", or \"app UI\"."
